title: >-
  OpenMP Offloading Intra-node: artifact for "Evaluating OpenMP
  Offloading for Intranode Multi-GPU Programming on NVIDIA, AMD, and
  Intel GPUs: A 3D Heat Transfer Case Study"
message: >-
  If you use this artifact, please cite both the artifact itself
  and the accompanying paper.
